        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: InfoPark, Kochi; Kochi; Kerala; India; London; England; Thrissur; Koratty\n- Organizations: EY; Tata Consultancy Services; Cognizant; Wipro; IBS Software Services; KPMG; EXL; Etisalat; UST Global; Nielsen Audio; Xerox; Conduent; Fingent\n- Systems: Hub and Spoke Model\n- Topics: information technology parks; professional services firms; Big Four accounting firms\n\nFacts:\n- InfoPark, Kochi is an information technology park in Kochi, Kerala, India.\n- InfoPark, Kochi has notable tenants including Tata Consultancy Services, Cognizant, Wipro, IBS Software Services, KPMG, EY, EXL, Etisalat, UST Global, Nielsen Audio, Xerox, Conduent, and Fingent.\n- EY, formerly Ernst & Young, is a multinational professional services firm headquartered in London, England.\n- EY is one of the largest professional services firms in the world and is one of the Big Four accounting firms.\n- InfoPark Thrissur is the first operational information technology park in the state under the Hub and Spoke Model, with InfoPark, Kochi as the hub and InfoPark Koratty as the spoke.",
